@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-01 - Browse Products

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Product UI" as FE
control "ShoesController / ReviewsController" as API
control "ShoesService / ReviewsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoes, shoesDetail, reviews" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-01
FE -> API: GET /shoes
API -> Service: Execute Browse Products
Service -> DB: Read/write shoes, shoesDetail, reviews
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách sản phẩm hiển thị

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: API lỗi -> hiển thị error state
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Không có
Post: Danh sách sản phẩm hiển thị
Main flow:
1. User truy cập trang chủ (/) hoặc trang /all-shoes
2. System gọi API GET /shoes
3. System trả về danh sách sản phẩm (name, price, thumbnail, colorName,\nrating, reviewCount)
4. Frontend render product cards với lazy loading
end note
@enduml
